Z||000000||bcwawright||05-18-2001||07:41 PM||||Was thinking about changing the coil(mine went south to the Carribean). Anybody had any experience with MSD or Accel. What part numbers and where can I get a good price?<BR>Thanks<P>Bruce<BR>88GT Turbo Spyder F355||||reg||5
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||05-18-2001||07:57 PM||||MSD Blaster-PN 121-8226  JEG'S $38.99 <A HREF="http://www.jegs.com" TARGET=_blank>www.jegs.com</A>   <P>I've had mine for about 2yrs with no problems<BR>Also try your local speed shop. Price is about the same at all places I've seen.<P>P.S.  My old one was good, Keep it in the car just in case!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>DXR_DAD<p>[This message has been edited by DXR_DAD (edited 05-18-2001).]||||reg||1
