Z||000003||cadaver||05-18-2001||09:52 PM||||I too have the MSD. Very happy with it. It takes like 5 minutes to install.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Black88GT||05-18-2001||10:12 PM||||My first Formula went through about 3 accel coils a year before I bought an MSD coil.  Worked out fine till I sold the car, now on my current GT I bought the MSD coil with the 6-AL box and I am very pleased.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff (AOL IM - FieroTT)<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif">     <BR><I>"Once you go black, you never go back..."</I><BR><I>"The Customer Can Have Any Color He Wants So Long As It's Black" </I> -Henry Ford||||reg||14
